{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49631","headline":"定风波 四 · 李珣","name":"定风波 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁过秋空夜未央，隔窗烟月锁莲塘。\n往事岂堪容易想，惆怅，故人迢遰在潇湘。\n纵有回文重叠意，谁寄，解鬟临镜泣残妆。\n沈水香消金鸭冷，愁永，候虫声接杵声长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}